  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of Guercif- Nador Highway Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to the development of infrastructure of different modes of transport in Morocco to cover the transport needs of the population and goods by 2040. Specifically, the project development objective is to contribute to improve the connectivity of the Oriental region and the NWM port complex. The project will contribute directly to reduce the transportation costs and travel times between the region and the rest of the country, road accidents and vehicle maintenance costs on the Guercif - Nador axis. The project will support decent and quality jobs creation, increase in the volumes of goods transiting through the port of Nador;</narrative>
  </description>
